Z||000000||V8Fiero||05-13-2001||06:05 PM||||Well after 2 yrs or so of working on the 84 its time to call it quits. The car sat all last winter with no coolant/water in it and I think there is too much corrosion for it to cool properly. I have tried running without a thermostat and it still overheats. Otherwise it runs great.....<BR>Anyone interested please take a look and make an offer........http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/003359.html<BR>||||reg||1
